OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fheavy showers are possible this
OL,7,Fevening, perhaps even thunderstorms.
OL,8,FStaying dry for most though with clear
OL,9,Fperiods at times overnight. Not as
OL,10,Funcomfortably warm as last night but
OL,11,Fremaining rather warm and humid,
OL,12,Fespecially in urban areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA dry day for most with
OL,15,Fincreasing amounts of sunshine through
OL,16,Fthe morning and staying fine during
OL,17,Fthe afternoon. Still warm, despite the
OL,18,Fnortherly breeze giving a somewhat
OL,19,Ffresher feel.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
